#: ../../source/users/preferences/display_settings.rst:5
msgid "Display settings"
msgstr "显示设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/display_settings.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows the user customizing many settings: `language`_, "
"`appearance`_, `export`_ and `printing`_ settings, pre-define `new project`_"
" settings, `element`_ collection paths, etc."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许用户自定义许多设置：`语言 <language_>`_，`外观 <appearance_>`_，`导出 "
"<export_>`_ 和 `打印 <printing_>`_ 设置，预定义 `新项目 <new project_>`_ 设置，`元件 "
"<element_>`_ 收藏路径等。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/display_settings.rst:10
msgid "To display QElectroTech settings:"
msgstr "要显示 QElectroTech 设置："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/display_settings.rst:12
msgid "Select **Settings > Configure QElectroTech** menu item."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 配置 QElectroTech** 菜单项。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/display_settings.rst:17
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech settings menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 设置菜单"
